   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "A good first step could be to contact the MLD Foundation, a patient group based in the United States that the atlas links to MLD [Ef09b1a9, E191273d, E7bd4f6c, E5a2235b]. Another step could be to contact the MPS Society, a patient group based in the United Kingdom that the atlas links to MLD [E1dfdb85, Ecfa62ac, E4ac6cf1]. You could also ask about joining the MLD Patient Powered Registry, which the atlas links to MLD [E5a2235b, E7bd4f6c].",
